      "headers": [
        "Sütun 1",
        "Marauder / / Your maximum life level and damage are reduced by 10% . If you obtain Relic of Heliordor , there is a chance you will obtain one more such item."
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Executioner In battle you have a chance to instantly execute the enemy if their health does not exceed 10% of the maximum. Execute restores 40% of your maximum life force. Works one time per battle and has no effect against bosses.",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Berserker / / You deal 25% more damage if you are not blocking . If you are defending yourself , you inflict only 25% damage. With each blow you lose health in the amount of 5% of damage dealt.",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Heretic / / You are silenced in battle. Damage dealt by you is increased by 100%.",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Fencer / / During battle, you have a chance to perform a fancy trick, causing your Strength, Wisdom, maximum health or critical hit chance to go up by 15% . Activates one time per fight.",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Living Corpse / / If you die in battle, you are immediately resurrected with 10% health and receive an effect that increases damage dealt by 300% for 30 seconds . If you do not reach your maximum health within the duration of the effect, you die without being able to be revived by this ability again in the current battle. This effect can only be triggered once every 1200 seconds and cannot be triggered if you were the last survivor of your team. / / Necrosis no longer reduces damage. However, the reduction in defence and maximum health has been increased to 55%.",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Bloodsucker / / You cannot use healing potions and scrolls. Crimson Roc's Gift will have no effect . Instead, your life is increased by 30% .",
            "items": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "",
            "items": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Enchanted / / Now Joining of the elements will only affect you if you have 3 or more different elemental effects on you at the same time.",
            "items": []
          }
        ]
      ],
      "source": "https://warofdragons.com/info/library/index.php?obj=cat&id=330"
